'''PARIVISION''' (also known as '''PVISION''' and '''TEAM VISION''') is a [[:Category:Serbia|Serbian]] esports team that entered the Dota 2 competitive scene in October 2024.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3
}}
{{tabs dynamic/tab|1}}<!--2024-->
*October 18 - A new roster is announced; [[Crystallis]], [[Noone|No[o]ne-]], [[DM]], [[9Class]] and [[Dukalis]].<ref name="pari 20241018">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-222578793_1452|title=PARIVISION врывается в Dota 2!|author=PARIVISION|date=2024-10-18}}</ref><ref>{{cite web|url=https://x.com/parivisiongg/status/1847291812441944237|title=PARIVISION breaks into Dota 2!|author=PARIVISION|date=2024-10-18}}</ref>
*October 22 - [[Astini]] joins the team as coach.<ref name="pari 20241022">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/C9Dota/status/1848798430271017175|title=We say goodbye to our coach, @astinidota, as he moves on to his next adventure with PARIVISION.|author=Cloud9|date=2024-10-22}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|2}}<!--2025-->
*January 8 - [[Satanic (Russian player)|Satanic]] joins the team on loan from [[Team Spirit]] while [[Crystallis]] is benched.<ref name="pari 20250108">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/parivisiongg/status/1877008769915277380|title=Welcome, @satanicdota!|author=PARIVISION|date=2025-01-08}}</ref>
*March 19 - [[Crystallis]] joins [[Tundra Esports]].<ref name="pari 20250319">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TundraEsports/status/1902382112646316404|title=The last piece of the puzzle has arrived!|author=TUNDRA|date=2025-03-19}}</ref>
*December 3 - The team parts ways with coach [[Astini]].<ref name="pari 20251203">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/parivisiongg/status/1996233596596531271|title=Today we say goodbye to our Dota 2 coach @astinidota.|author=PARIVISION|date=2025-12-03}}</ref>

{{tabs dynamic/tab|3}}<!--2026-->
*January 28 - [[Puppey]] joins as coach.<ref name="pari 20260128">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/parivisiongg/status/2016445951418732544|title=After a short test period at DreamLeague S26, we decided to continue working with Clement @CLEMENTINATOR Ivanov.|author=PARIVISION|date=2026-01-28}}</ref>
*January 31 - [[DM]] is benched.<ref name="pari 20260131">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/parivisiongg/status/2017599097344077852|title=Dmitry «DM» Dorokhin is benched and is open to new offers|author=PARIVISION|date=2026-01-31}}</ref>
*February 1 - [[SSS]] joins the team.<ref name="pari 20260201">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/parivisiongg/status/2017977542393614337|title=Valery «SSS» Lazarev joins our Dota roster|author=PARIVISION|date=2026-02-01}}</ref>
*May 24 - [[DM]] joins [[Team Yandex]].<ref name="pari 20260524">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/team_yandex_dota_2/1782|title=Для тех, кто внимательно следит за профессиональной сценой Dota 2, это уже не новость. Но теперь мы рады объявить об этом официально. К Team Yandex присоединяется Дмитрий DM Дорохин — он займет позицию оффлейнера. Женя Noticed переведен в запас.|trans_title=For those who closely follow the Dota 2 professional scene, this is no longer news. But now we are happy to announce it officially. Dmitry DM Dorokhin joins Team Yandex  - he will take the position of offlaner. Zhenya "Noticed" is transferred to the reserve.|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|author=Team Yandex|author-link=Team Yandex|date=2026-05-24}}</ref>
*June 20 - [[SSS]] is benched while [[Noticed]] joins the team.<ref name="pari 20260620s">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PARIVISIONdota2/status/2068333082059395492|title=Valery «SSS» Lazarev is moving to the bench and is open to new offers|author=PARIVISION|date=2026-06-20}}</ref><ref name="pari 20260620n">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/PARIVISIONdota2/status/2068336698430312666|title=Evgeny «Noticed» Ignatenko is joining our Dota roster on a permanent basis|author=PARIVISION|date=2026-06-20}}</ref>
